and a collection of photos of them, you know, when you look at them and, I can share an image with you to go on the podcast or a website. It's astonishing how varied they are. I mean, even when we show it to people that are in the field and have been in the field for a decade, they're like, whoa, okay, these are really, really different. I mean, it's sort of like thinking, you know, I could take you and study you as an example of an extrovert and then, you know, journalized to all the extroverts, but we know that

