Like, how do I make it warm or cold or competent or incompetent? warmth, it turns out, is really driven by eyes. So does it have eyes or not? Which you wouldn't normally think of right away. But they don't. I mean, G-GBO doesn't have eyes, for example. Right, exactly, exactly. So that's a major thing.

