the default group, the high-competence, high-warmth, that was white middle-class America. And you go down into the lower space where it's high-competence, low-warmth, these are like engineers, rich people. And these people are, they evoke a difference. different kind of emotion. So it's envy, right? So in a little bit, so you like, you admire them a little bit, but it's more like a little suspicious. So they evoke this, this envy thing. Whereas the default group evokes like admiration and positive emotions. You keep going around, so you're

