And the emotion to evoke there is pity. So as a designer, if you're designing a robot with these different features, unbeknownst to you, you could actually be causing an initial emotional response that is deep-seated in our psychology. That's pretty interesting. Yeah, we thought so. So, does this research tie in at all with the work that you're doing on deception? Yeah, so now we're doing a bunch of things about like trust of robots. So how much would you trust this robot?

